### ghostty-web 0.4.0 — MIT

ghostty-web is a JavaScript package. Its code, and the WebAssembly module inside
it, are embedded in the pirate binary. cargo-about reads Rust crates only, so
this section is static text in `about.hbs`.

NOTE: ghostty-web was AGPL-3.0 at version 0.1.0. Version 0.4.0 is MIT. Read
